import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 842 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Perpetual Iteration of Multiplication-Fruit Technologization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 842 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Perpetual Iteration of Multiplication-Fruit Technologization","no":842,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Multiplication Fruit","Deduction Engine","Technology Iteration","Opening Buff"],"related":["16-Multiplication-Fruit Technologization Principle","61-Multiplication-Fruit Engineering Application","11-Deduction-Iteration System Detailed","68-Technology Ethics and Safety Boundaries"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0842_模块4-超脱者与科技-倍增果实永续迭代.md","filePath":"en/0842_模块4-超脱者与科技-倍增果实永续迭代.md"}'),a={name:"en/0842_模块4-超脱者与科技-倍增果实永续迭代.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-842-transcended-ones-and-technology-perpetual-iteration-of-multiplication-fruit-technologization" tabindex="-1">Entry 842 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Perpetual Iteration of Multiplication-Fruit Technologization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-842-transcended-ones-and-technology-perpetual-iteration-of-multiplication-fruit-technologization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 842 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Perpetual Iteration of Multiplication-Fruit Technologization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 16, 11, 61, 68</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-one-opening-buff-can-evolve-into-a-perpetual-evolution-engine" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why one &quot;opening buff&quot; can evolve into a perpetual-evolution engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-one-opening-buff-can-evolve-into-a-perpetual-evolution-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why one &quot;opening buff&quot; can evolve into a perpetual-evolution engine&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old worldview, an &quot;opening buff&quot; is one-time: the protagonist picks up a treasure, eats a divine pill, has fun in the early stage, later still has to cultivate hard. Heng Yuan Zhou completely transforms the Multiplication Fruit &quot;opening buff&quot; into something else — it is not only opening fun, but technologized into a <strong>perpetually iterating deduction engine</strong>, becoming the whole civilization&#39;s evolution accelerator. This entry explains: how the transcended one turns the Multiplication Fruit from &quot;one person&#39;s cheat&quot; into Myriad Ranks&#39; shared, self-iterating public infrastructure.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires this accelerator not be monopolized, shared network-wide; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires it serve Myriad Ranks, not only strong ones&#39; private cheat; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires its iteration direction point to common uplift; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires deduction results not be directly used as action basis, must be reality-validated; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the engine&#39;s multiplication mechanism be self-consistent and stable, not collapse with version iteration.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-from-fruit-to-engine-technologization-leap" tabindex="-1">I. From &quot;Fruit&quot; to &quot;Engine&quot; Technologization Leap <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-from-fruit-to-engine-technologization-leap" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. From &quot;Fruit&quot; to &quot;Engine&quot; Technologization Leap&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 61 makes it clear: the Multiplication Fruit is not for eating, but walks the three steps of &quot;law extraction — mechanism analysis — engineering reconstruction.&quot; Its essence is locked as <strong>exponential amplification of information-processing efficiency</strong> — within the same time, completing a hundred-fold parallel deduction path. This leap&#39;s key is:</p><ul><li>Transform &quot;personal special ability from eating the fruit&quot; into &quot;public compute anyone may call&quot;;</li><li>Transform &quot;one-time stat spike&quot; into &quot;continuously outputting deduction acceleration&quot;;</li><li>Transform &quot;protagonist-exclusive cheat&quot; into &quot;whole-civilization evolution infrastructure.&quot;</li></ul><p>This is why it is an &quot;opening buff&quot; but not &quot;used up at opening&quot; — after being engineered, every generation is getting stronger.</p><h2 id="ii-three-tier-deployment-and-perpetual-iteration" tabindex="-1">II. Three-Tier Deployment and Perpetual Iteration <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-tier-deployment-and-perpetual-iteration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three-Tier Deployment and Perpetual Iteration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The deduction engine adopts a &quot;core — array — network&quot; three-tier architecture (Document 61), and on this basis perpetually iterates:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Deployment Tier</th><th>Parallelism</th><th>Served Object</th><th>Iteration Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Personal-terminal type</td><td>100x base value</td><td>Individual cultivator</td><td>Optimize portability, lower consciousness load</td></tr><tr><td>Research-center type</td><td>1000x+</td><td>Research institutions</td><td>Expand array scale, fuse more laws</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor-integrated type</td><td>Global</td><td>Anchor network globally</td><td>Provide global deduction capability for the whole network</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&quot;Perpetual iteration&quot;&#39;s key is: the engine not only runs faster and faster, but also returns every deduction&#39;s data to the anchor network, feeding itself with Myriad Ranks&#39; real cultivation data. It is not a static machine, but a <strong>public intelligence that gets smarter the more it is used.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-why-it-is-perpetual-rather-than-one-time" tabindex="-1">III. Why It Is &quot;Perpetual&quot; Rather Than &quot;One-Time&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-it-is-perpetual-rather-than-one-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why It Is &quot;Perpetual&quot; Rather Than &quot;One-Time&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multiplication-Fruit technologization&#39;s ability to be perpetual roots in what it serves — the cultivation system itself — being infinitely iterable:</p><ul><li>The deduction engine helps cultivators verify paths; verification results are returned, optimizing next deduction;</li><li>The engine helps research accelerate law discovery; new laws in turn become new deduction material;</li><li>The engine helps crisis rehearsal; rehearsal experience deposits into new safety boundaries.</li></ul><p>This is a positive feedback: <strong>used more → data thicker → deduction more accurate → evolution faster → produces more data.</strong> As long as Myriad Ranks are still evolving, this engine always has an iteration direction. It is not a &quot;use-and-discard&quot; opening prop, but civilization&#39;s perpetual-motion construction (from entry 721) compute heart.</p><h2 id="iv-ethics-boundary-the-accelerator-may-not-be-used-to-open-evil-roads" tabindex="-1">IV. Ethics Boundary: The Accelerator May Not Be Used to Open Evil Roads <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-ethics-boundary-the-accelerator-may-not-be-used-to-open-evil-roads" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Ethics Boundary: The Accelerator May Not Be Used to Open Evil Roads&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The stronger the accelerator, the more we must hold the ethics red line (Document 68). Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s boundaries on deduction-engine use:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not deduce predation</strong>: the engine may not be used to deduce predatory cultivation paths or solutions harming others;</li><li><strong>Do not replace reality</strong>: deduction results must be reality-validated before execution; &quot;using deduction to replace actual combat&quot; is prohibited;</li><li><strong>Do not overload</strong>: personal-terminal parallelism sets an upper limit, preventing individual deduction overload from damaging consciousness;</li><li><strong>Supervise throughout</strong>: high-risk deductions (cross-plane, time-rewind type) proceed under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</li></ul><p>The accelerator is for &quot;walking the right road faster,&quot; not &quot;walking the evil road faster.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: transforming a one-time opening buff into a perpetual accelerator turns a hundred-fold deduction capability from personal cheat into public infrastructure</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: engine shared network-wide, does not deduce predatory paths, seals &quot;using acceleration cheat to monopolize evolution&quot; predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s ability relies on Gu Chensha&#39;s one-time bestowal, ends when used; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s engine perpetually iterates, stronger and more accurate the more used</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: personal-terminal type faces all cultivators, adapted per life form, not exclusive to strong ones</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: engine architecture, parameters, and ethics boundaries all public, continuously iterating as civilization upgrades</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-engine-publicization-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Engine Publicization and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-engine-publicization-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Engine Publicization and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After the deduction engine changes from &quot;personal cheat&quot; to &quot;public infrastructure,&quot; every iteration no longer belongs to some person. The engine&#39;s deployment breadth, cultivation time saved for Myriad Ranks, and demonic-obsession accidents avoided are all converted into the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight — the more inclusive and safer this engine, the higher the weight of the transcended one driving it. The engine&#39;s ethics boundaries are also written into Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: once someone is found using it to deduce predatory paths, immediately suspend the account and trace back. Precisely because this smarter-and-smarter machine is publicized, supervised, and metered, it will not degenerate into the strong ones&#39; monopolized acceleration privilege, but truly become the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s shared evolution heart.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multiplication-Fruit technologization&#39;s perpetual iteration is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;opening buff&quot; philosophy&#39;s ultimate demonstration: not leaving magical power to the protagonist alone, but decomposing it into mechanisms, engineering it into an engine, opening it to Myriad Ranks, then letting it self-iterate on Myriad Ranks&#39; data. When an accelerator that gets smarter the more it is used serves everyone, civilization&#39;s evolution speed enters a positive loop. This is what an &quot;opening buff&quot; should look like in a symbiotic civilization — not pleasure for a moment, but benefiting Myriad Ranks and iterating forever.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication-Fruit Technologization Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/61-倍增果实工程化应用.html">Entry 61 · Multiplication-Fruit Engineering Application</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Detailed</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/68-技术伦理与安全边界.html">Entry 68 · Technology Ethics and Safety Boundaries</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
